              id="2b1a3143-55fb-4dd1-b46d-177552e3add8" name="Shape Shoulder" description="Grader Operator activity - shape and maintain road shoulders. Realizes the &amp;#x27;Shape Shoulder&amp;#x27; operational capability."/>
